      ]
    },
    {
      "number": "52",
      "text": "52. \u7ea6\u5206\uff1a\na) $\\frac{x^2+x-56}{49-14x+x^2}$\uff1b\nb) $\\frac{(2y-3)^2-1}{y^2+7y-8}$\u3002",
      "figure_ids": []
